###Request
POST https://testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/orderdata/svc/orders/search HTTP/1.1

$[?(@.pnr == 'MISSING')]
$[?(@.firstName == 'Jane')]
$[?(@.lastName == 'Doe')]

###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "pnr": false,
  "isGroup": false,
  "firstName": false,
  "surname": false
}
